OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times overnight,
OL,7,Fbefore clearing to only a few light
OL,8,Fshowers for Orkney towards dawn.
OL,9,FSoutherly gales veer to a strong
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAny persistent rain across
OL,13,FShetland soon clearing. Otherwise a
OL,14,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,15,Fspells during morning. Outbreaks
OL,16,Fbuilding for afternoon, bringing the
OL,17,Frisk of thunderstorms. Brisk southwest
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
